     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Good morning,<div><br></div><div>Would it be possible to post the following in your group? </div><div><br></div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I am a psych Ph.D. student looking to hire an RA to finish an R script that implements an algorithm to calculate reliability statistics with second-to-second data. Most of the code is already written. Hourly pay through UC Davis. Please contact Elisa Ugarte (<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">eug...@ucdavis.edu</a>).</div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote>Thank you so much,</div><div>Elisa<br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);color:rgb(29,28,29);font-family:Slack-Lato,appleLogo,sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures:common-ligatures\"><br></span></div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"georgia, serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><b>Elisa Ugarte, M.A.</b></span></font></div><div><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">her/ella</span><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"georgia, serif\">Doctoral Student </font></div><div><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Department of Human Ecology</span><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"georgia, serif\">Human Development Graduate Group </font></div><div><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">UC Davis Center for Mind &amp; Brain</span><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"georgia, serif\">202 Cousteau Place</font></div